  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"app-title\">\n    <h1 id=\"app-title\">Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML page with accessible buttons and output element."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #8a8a9a;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 64px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  min-width: 72px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: var(--card);\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.05s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--card);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .count { font-size: 48px; }\n  button { min-width: 64px; padding: 10px 12px; }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-style CSS with cohesive palette and responsive layout."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "let count = 0;\nconst countEl = document.getElementById('count');\n\nfunction update(delta) {\n  count += delta;\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => update(1));\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => update(-1));\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n});",
      "description": "JavaScript logic for increment, decrement, and reset."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA tiny offline pixel-style counter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Starts at `0`\n- `+1` button increments the count\n- `-1` button decrements the count (supports negative numbers)\n- `Reset` button returns the count to `0`\n- Fully keyboard accessible: tab to a button and press Enter or Space\n- Responsive layout works from 360px wide\n- No dependencies, no network requests, no storage\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use the keyboard to change the count.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and accessible controls\n- `styles.css` — pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` — counter logic\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Buttons have `aria-label` descriptions\n- The count uses `aria-live=\"polite\"` so changes are announced\n- Visible focus outlines and pressed states",
      "description": "README with usage and accessibility notes."
    }
  ]
}